OL,3,GNEWSAWinter preparations under way for
OL,4,Aregion's roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreparations for next season's wintry
OL,7,Fweather are under way across a region.
OL,9,FSeveral new gritters are due to operate
OL,10,Fon Cumberland's roads, as the council
OL,11,Fsaid it would invite residents and
OL,12,Fschools to suggest names for four of
OL,13,Fthe vehicles soon.
OL,15,FCumberland Council said it had also
OL,16,Fbegan checking and refilling about
OL,17,F2,000 yellow grit bins and replenishing
OL,18,Fits salt stocks.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
