OL,3,GNEWSAWinter preparations under way for
OL,4,Aregion's roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office said it expected the
OL,7,Finfluence of El Nino - a powerful
OL,8,Fnatural climate phenomenon - would
OL,9,Fincrease the chances of wetter,
OL,10,Fstormier conditions in the coming
OL,11,Fautumn and early winter.
